on" tabindex="0" aria-control="sub-menu-77970" aria-expanded="false"></span></div><ul id="sub-menu-77970" class="sub-menu">	<li id="menu-item-24" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://www.kcnq2cure.org/our-role/">Our Role</a></li>	<li id="menu-item-27" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://www.kcnq2cure.org/our-role/our-team/">Our Team</a></li>	<li id="menu-item-26" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://www.kcnq2cure.org/our-role/scientific-advisory-board/">Scientific Advisory Board</a></li>	<li id="menu-item-78319" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://www.kcnq2cure.org/interns/">Interns</a></li>	<li id="menu-item-52" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://www.kcnq2cure.org/global-reach/">Global Reach</a></li>	<li id="menu-item-76793" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom"><a href="https://www.kcnq2cure.org/our-role/#finances">Finances</a></li>	<li id="menu-item-25" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://www.kcnq2cure.org/contact-us/">Contact Us</a></li></ul></li></ul></nav></div>
	</div>
